BY002 [*] Conditional expression can be written as `?.`
 --> BY002.by:3:9
  |
1 | def f(user, index):
2 |     # both orderings of the guard
3 |     _ = None if user is None else user.name
  |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
4 |     _ = user.name if user is not None else None
  |
help: Replace with `?.`
  |
2 |     # both orderings of the guard
  -     _ = None if user is None else user.name
3 +     _ = user?.name
4 |     _ = user.name if user is not None else None
  |

BY002 [*] Conditional expression can be written as `?.`
 --> BY002.by:4:9
